# Frontend build-time settings (Vite). Copy to .env.local if needed.
# Demo quick-login buttons (Admin / Co-admin / Viewer) show ONLY in `npm run dev`.
# A production build hides them. To show them in a build (public demo site only, and the server must have
# SEED_DEMO=true), set:
# VITE_DEMO_LOGIN=true
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com/api     # production API base (default: /api via the Vite dev proxy)
